          "bbox": [
            0.248,
            0.228,
            0.879,
            0.263
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "注:独有的答题必须先为起纸上，凡答化讲起上一律无效"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.265,
            0.446,
            0.281
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "一. 选择回答（每题2分，共30分）:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.141,
            0.284,
            0.697,
            0.301
          ],
          "content": "(下列各题均有四个供选择的答案，请选择最合适的一个填在括号中)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.303,
            0.73,
            0.337
          ],
          "content": "1. 一段 RNA 序列 pApGpGpApCpApUpCpApU，用下列哪种酶处理可产生 5'-单核苷酸？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.342,
            0.249,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": "A. RNase A,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
            0.343,
            0.374,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": "B. RNasc T1,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.389,
            0.343,
            0.553,
            0.358
          ],
          "content": "C. 蛇毒磷酸二酯酶，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.572,
            0.343,
            0.71,
            0.358
          ],
          "content": "D. 脾磷酸二酯酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.36,
            0.456,
            0.376
          ],
          "content": "2.下述哪种 DNA 复性的速都最快？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.38,
            0.285,
            0.414
          ],
          "content": "A. E.coli DNA,\n+ PolyA"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.306,
            0.381,
            0.449,
            0.396
          ],
          "content": "B. λ-Phage DNA"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.473,
            0.381,
            0.639,
            0.397
          ],
          "content": "C. 小牛非重复 DNA,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.663,
            0.381,
            0.729,
            0.397
          ],
          "content": "D.PolyU"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.418,
            0.729,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": "3. 酶的 Km 可以从反应速度对底物浓度所作的双倒数图中求得。关于酶 Km 的下面论述正确的是（）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.456,
            0.286,
            0.472
          ],
          "content": "A. 曲线的斜率，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.367,
            0.457,
            0.585,
            0.473
          ],
          "content": "B. 曲线在纵坐标上的截距，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.475,
            0.297,
            0.491
          ],
          "content": "C. 曲线的横截距，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.369,
            0.476,
            0.62,
            0.492
          ],
          "content": "D. 曲线在横坐标上截距的倒数"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.494,
            0.72,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": "4. 受体在激素的作用下与腺苷酸环化酶的偶联是由下面哪种因素实现的？（）."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.533,
            0.236,
            0.548
          ],
          "content": "A. cAMP,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.259,
            0.534,
            0.333,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": "B. cGMP,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.357,
            0.534,
            0.443,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": "C. G 蛋白，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.469,
            0.534,
            0.573,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": "D. 钙调蛋白"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.552,
            0.727,
            0.586
          ],
          "content": "5. 鸟氨酸循环是一种跨亚细胞结构的代谢反应。下述发生在线粒体中的反应是（）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.59,
            0.727,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": "A. 氨甲酰磷酸的合成；B. 精氨琥珀酸的合成；C. 精氨琥珀酸的裂解；D. 尿素的生成"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.628,
            0.727,
            0.663
          ],
          "content": "6. 关于胰蛋白酶、胰凝乳蛋白酶和弹性蛋白酶的下面叙述，除何者外都是正确的？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.667,
            0.376,
            0.701
          ],
          "content": "A. 三者都是丝氨酸蛋白酶，\n肽酶，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.478,
            0.668,
            0.726,
            0.7
          ],
          "content": "B. 前两者是内肽酶，后者是外"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.705,
            0.46,
            0.74
          ],
          "content": "C. 二者具有相同的“电荷转接系统”，同源性"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.476,
            0.706,
            0.727,
            0.722
          ],
          "content": "D. 三者在一级结构上有很大的"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.743,
            0.612,
            0.76
          ],
          "content": "7. 下面哪种氨基酸常出现在球状蛋白质分子的表面？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.763,
            0.216,
            0.779
          ],
          "content": "A. Val,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.247,
            0.764,
            0.302,
            0.779
          ],
          "content": "B.Ala,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.335,
            0.764,
            0.391,
            0.779
          ],
          "content": "C. Phe,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.425,
            0.764,
            0.476,
            0.779
          ],
          "content": "D. Pro"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.781,
            0.574,
            0.798
          ],
          "content": "8.下面哪种顺序不会被 DNA 限制性内切酶识别？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.801,
            0.259,
            0.817
          ],
          "content": "A. GTAATC,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.282,
            0.802,
            0.379,
            0.817
          ],
          "content": "B. GTATAC,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.402,
            0.802,
            0.503,
            0.818
          ],
          "content": "C. GAATTC,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.527,
            0.802,
            0.624,
            0.818
          ],
          "content": "D. CAATTG"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.82,
            0.673,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": "9. 下面是关于 RNA 合成的有关叙述，除何者外都是正确的？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.84,
            0.38,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": "A. RNA 的合成不需要引物，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.425,
            0.841,
            0.727,
            0.858
          ],
          "content": "B. RNA 的合成可同时发生在 DNA 两"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.042,
            0.273,
            0.06
          ],
          "content": "条链上，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.066,
            0.85,
            0.106
          ],
          "content": "C. RNA 聚合酶核心酶催化 RNA 链的延长，D. rho 因子是一种转录终止因子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.111,
            0.823,
            0.133
          ],
          "content": "10. 下面分子用  ${}^{14}C$  标记后，除何者外都能出现在软脂酸分子中？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.135,
            0.269,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": "A. 葡萄糖，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.297,
            0.136,
            0.404,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": "B. 丙氨酸,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.422,
            0.137,
            0.546,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": "C.  $CH_{3}COO^{-}$ ,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.564,
            0.137,
            0.655,
            0.156
          ],
          "content": "D.  $HCO_{3}^{-}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.159,
            0.85,
            0.18
          ],
          "content": "11. 下面是关于细菌蛋白质合成的有关叙述，除何者外都是正确的是（）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.182,
            0.848,
            0.269
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "A. 起始氨酰-tRNA 进入到核糖体大亚基的 A 部位, B. 肽链的延长反应中需要 GTP,\nB. 移位反应需要 EF-Tu， D. 肽链合成的终止只需要一种终止密码子的存在"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.275,
            0.848,
            0.316
          ],
          "content": "12. 把 1 摩尔天冬氨酸与肌肉匀浆物一起保温，完全氧化产生的 ATP 摩尔数是（）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.321,
            0.223,
            0.339
          ],
          "content": "A. 27,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.269,
            0.322,
            0.327,
            0.339
          ],
          "content": "B. 18,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.361,
            0.323,
            0.418,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": "C. 15,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.453,
            0.323,
            0.505,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": "D. 12"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.345,
            0.848,
            0.385
          ],
          "content": "13. 下述酶反应除何者外在 DNA 合成时 RNA 引物切除及缺口的填补中涉及？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.391,
            0.848,
            0.457
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "A. DNA 聚合酶 1 的  $5^{\\circ} \\rightarrow 3^{\\circ}$  外切酶活性，B. DNA 聚合酶 1 的聚合酶活性，\nC. DNA 聚合酶Ⅲ全酶，\nD. DNA 连接酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.46,
            0.848,
            0.502
          ],
          "content": "14. 当用  ${}^{14}$ C 标记乳酸的羧基碳原子、并经受在细胞内的代谢转变。下面化合物除何者外都含有  ${}^{14}$ C 标记？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.507,
            0.32,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": "A. α-酮戊二酸，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.351,
            0.508,
            0.484,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": "B. 乙酰 CoA,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.517,
            0.509,
            0.625,
            0.527
          ],
          "content": "C. 丙氨酸，"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.671,
            0.51,
            0.772,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": "D. 葡萄糖"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.565,
            0.701,
            0.585
          ],
          "content": "15. 下述氨基酸中能为嘧啶环的合成提供 N 原子的是（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.589,
            0.23,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": "A. Gly,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.27,
            0.59,
            0.338,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": "B. Asn,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.368,
            0.59,
            0.436,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": "C. Glu,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.466,
            0.591,
            0.532,
            0.61
          ],
          "content": "D. Asp"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.634,
            0.464,
            0.655
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "二. 填空题（每空2分，共30分）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.658,
            0.844,
            0.698
          ],
          "content": "1. 真核生物 mRNA 5' 端甲基化的鸟嘌呤核苷酸为（）提供了可识别的标志。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.704,
            0.844,
            0.744
          ],
          "content": "2.（）是天冬氨酸转氨甲酰基酶的别构抑制剂，而（）是该酶的别构激活剂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.75,
            0.844,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": "3. DNA 的转录链与它的（）的顺序是非互补的，而它的编码链是不被（）的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.796,
            0.843,
            0.835
          ],
          "content": "4. 一种氨基酸与它专一的 tRNA 结合是由（）决定的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.842,
            0.657,
            0.861
          ],
          "content": "5. 酶的经典性竞争抑制剂与酶的底物的结构是（）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.865,
            0.841,
            0.908
          ],
          "content": "6. 一种具净正电荷的蛋白质会强烈地同阳离子交换剂结合，洗脱时应需使用比最初缓冲液 pH（）的、或者离子强度（）的缓冲液。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
